---
// AboutSection.astro - 07 / Studio & Founder (Xichi AI Studio, Cikarang Utara, Bekasi)
---

<section class="about-home-section" id="about">
  <header class="section-header">
    <p>07 / Studio & Founder</p>
    <h2>
      <span class="word"><span>DIBANGUN</span></span>{' '}
      <span class="word"><span>DI</span></span>{' '}
      <span class="word"><span>CIKARANG</span></span>{' '}
      <span class="word"><span>UTARA.</span></span>
    </h2>
  </header>

  <div class="about-home-grid">
    <!-- Founder Card -->
    <div class="about-founder-card">
      <div class="founder-badge-strip">
        <span class="badge-role">FOUNDER & LEAD ARCHITECT</span>
        <span class="badge-loc">📍 CIKARANG UTARA, BEKASI</span>
      </div>

      <div class="founder-profile-row">
        <div class="founder-avatar">
          <img src="/assets/logoxichi.jpg" alt="Irsyad - Founder Xichi AI" class="founder-avatar-img" />
        </div>
        <div class="founder-meta">
          <h3 class="founder-name">Irsyad</h3>
          <p class="founder-title">Lead Hardware & Software Architect • Founder Xichi AI</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="founder-tags">
        <span class="tag">ESP32-S3 Embedded</span>
        <span class="tag">Edge AI & Audio DSP</span>
        <span class="tag">Distributed Cloud</span>
        <span class="tag">Pelopor Xiaozhi ID</span>
      </div>

      <p class="founder-bio">
        Merintis riset sistem IoT, arsitektur distributed computing, dan rekayasa firmware mikrokontroler. Mengembangkan Xichi dari eksperimen breadboard di meja kerja hingga menjadi ekosistem produk utuh yang mencakup hardware fisik, arsitektur firmware terpadu, mobile BLE companion, dan katalog 47 alat cerdas terintegrasi.
      </p>

      <div class="founder-actions">
        <a href="https://github.com/Franklnir" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-about-action outline">
          <span>GitHub Repositori</span>
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#pengadaan" class="btn-about-action solid">
          <span>Layanan Pengadaan</span>
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Studio Pillars & Vision -->
    <div class="about-studio-card">
      <div class="studio-top">
        <span class="badge-role">FOKUS & LANDASAN RISET</span>
        <h3 class="studio-heading">3 Pilar Rekayasa Xichi AI Studio</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="pillars-list">
        <div class="pillar-item">
          <div class="pillar-icon">⚙️</div>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h4>Hardware Prototyping & Casing Modular</h4>
            <p>Perancangan skema PCB terpadu, pemilihan komponen audio I2S amplifier berkualitas, manajemen termal chip ESP32, dan casing modular presisi.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-item">
          <div class="pillar-icon">🧠</div>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h4>Voice AI Pipeline & Semantic Memory</h4>
            <p>Optimasi kompresi audio Opus, penanganan audio buffering bebas jeda, dan arsitektur memori semantik untuk dialog kontekstual jangka panjang.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-item">
          <div class="pillar-icon">🌐</div>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h4>Komunitas Terbuka Xiaozhi Indonesia</h4>
            <p>Kolaborasi terbuka dengan komunitas Xiaozhi Indonesia dan developer open-source untuk pembaruan fitur berkelanjutan dan standarisasi tools MCP.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="studio-stats-strip">
        <div class="stat-mini">
          <strong>100%</strong>
          <span>Dirakit Lokal di Cikarang Utara</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-mini">
          <strong>47 TOOLS</strong>
          <span>MCP Superpowers Aktif</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-mini">
          <strong>XIAOZHISCIG</strong>
          <span>Server Resmi Indonesia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-home-section {
    padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 100px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 40px);
    background: #ebebeb !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-home-section .section-header p {
    display: inline-block !important;
    background: #e4e61e !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    border: 1.5px solid #0c0c0c !important;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #0c0c0c !important;
    border-radius: 999px !important;
    padding: 5px 16px !important;
    font-weight: 800 !important;
    font-size: 12px !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em !important;
    text-transform: uppercase !important;
    margin-bottom: 14px !important;
  }

  .about-home-section .section-header h2,
  .about-home-section .section-header h2 .word > span {
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    font-family: 'Sora', system-ui, sans-serif !important;
    font-weight: 800 !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
    visibility: visible !important;
    transform: none !important;
  }

  .about-home-grid {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 48px auto 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  /* Founder Card */
  .about-founder-card {
    background: #ffffff !important;
    border: 2px solid #0c0c0c !important;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0c0c0c !important;
    border-radius: 20px !important;
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px) !important;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: relative;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
  }

  .founder-badge-strip {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .badge-role {
    display: inline-block !important;
    padding: 5px 14px !important;
    background: #e4e61e !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    font-size: 11px !important;
    font-weight: 800 !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em !important;
    border: 1.5px solid #0c0c0c !important;
    border-radius: 999px !important;
  }

  .badge-loc {
    display: inline-block !important;
    padding: 5px 14px !important;
    background: #ffffff !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    font-size: 11px !important;
    font-weight: 800 !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em !important;
    border: 1.5px solid #0c0c0c !important;
    border-radius: 999px !important;
  }

  .founder-profile-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .founder-avatar {
    width: 68px;
    height: 68px;
    background: #e4e61e !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    border: 2px solid #0c0c0c !important;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #0c0c0c !important;
    border-radius: 50% !important;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 900;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .founder-name {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px) !important;
    font-weight: 800 !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif !important;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .founder-title {
    font-size: 13.5px !important;
    color: #4f4f4f !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .founder-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .founder-tags .tag {
    padding: 5px 12px !important;
    background: #ebebeb !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(12, 12, 12, 0.15) !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    border-radius: 999px !important;
    font-size: 11.5px !important;
    font-weight: 700 !important;
  }

  .founder-bio {
    font-size: 14px !important;
    color: #4f4f4f !important;
    line-height: 1.7 !important;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .founder-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .btn-about-action {
    display: inline-flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    gap: 8px !important;
    padding: 11px 22px !important;
    font-size: 13.5px !important;
    font-weight: 700 !important;
    border-radius: 999px !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease !important;
    cursor: pointer !important;
  }

  .btn-about-action.solid {
    background: #0c0c0c !important;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    border: 1.5px solid #0c0c0c !important;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12) !important;
  }

  .btn-about-action.solid:hover {
    background: #1f1f1f !important;
    transform: translateY(-2px) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) !important;
  }

  .btn-about-action.outline {
    background: #ffffff !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    border: 1.5px solid #0c0c0c !important;
  }

  .btn-about-action.outline:hover {
    background: #ebebeb !important;
    transform: translateY(-2px) !important;
  }

  /* Studio Card */
  .about-studio-card {
    background: #ffffff !important;
    border: 2px solid #0c0c0c !important;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0c0c0c !important;
    border-radius: 20px !important;
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px) !important;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
  }

  .studio-top {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .studio-heading {
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 24px) !important;
    font-weight: 800 !important;
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    margin-top: 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pillars-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .pillar-item {
    display: flex !important;
    gap: 14px !important;
    align-items: flex-start !important;
    padding: 14px 16px !important;
    background: #ffffff !important;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(12, 12, 12, 0.14) !important;
    border-radius: 14px !important;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04) !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease !important;
  }

  .pillar-item:hover {
    border-color: #0c0c0c !important;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #0c0c0c !important;
    transform: translateY(-2px) !important;
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    font-size: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    line-height: 1;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }

  .pillar-body h4 {
    font-size: 15px !important;
    font-weight: 800 !important;
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .pillar-body p {
    font-size: 13.5px !important;
    color: #4f4f4f !important;
    line-height: 1.6 !important;
  }

  .studio-stats-strip {
    display: grid !important;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) !important;
    gap: 10px !important;
    background: #fafaf5 !important;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(12, 12, 12, 0.14) !important;
    border-radius: 14px !important;
    padding: 16px 12px !important;
    text-align: center !important;
  }

  .stat-mini strong {
    display: block !important;
    color: #0c0c0c !important;
    font-size: 16px !important;
    font-weight: 900 !important;
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif !important;
  }

  .stat-mini span {
    display: block !important;
    color: #4f4f4f !important;
    font-size: 11.5px !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-home-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .studio-stats-strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 12px;
    }
  }
  .founder-avatar-img {
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 100% !important;
    object-fit: cover !important;
  }
</style>
